Correction in v1.2 (2026-10-04), one added line of the repository edition:
  include/net/tcp.h TCP_ECN_ECT_PERMANENT 3 -> 32, the value used by Google's
  BBRv3 tree (google/bbr 90210de4b779d40496dee0b89081780eeddf2a60). The value 3
  overlapped TCP_ECN_OK|TCP_ECN_QUEUE_CWR, so tcp_ecn_send() kept ECT on pure ACKs
  and retransmissions of every ECN-negotiated connection. The tcp.h index line
  carries the new postimage blob. All other added lines are unchanged.
